   Command & Conquer: Red Alert 2 is the second in the Red Alert series
   from Westwood. After the first Red Alert, the Soviets were set under
   strict military guidelines. The rest of the world prospered, and the
   United States emerged as the clear world leader, and proclamied itself
   the leader in democracy and peace. Unbeknownst to the rest of the world
   however, the Soviets secretly researched war technologies such as mind
   control and portable tesla generators. As the game begins, the Soviets
   launch a massive attack against the US in San Francisco, Washington D.C.,
   Texas, and New York.

   Red Alert 2 will feature an enhanced version of the C&C: Tiberian Sun
   engine. The Allies and the Soviets will have greatly enhanced 
   technologies such as mind control devices, tactical nukes, futuristic
   chrono technology, weather control devices, and much more. Battles will
   be fought on US soil, with many national landmarks appearing in the maps.
   Support for Westwood Online will be included. 

